[CENTER]
[SIZE=6][COLOR=#00d2ff][B]📖 PluginsHider Documentation & Setup Guide[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]
[SIZE=3][COLOR=#a0aec0]Author: [B]Lino[/B] • Platform: Spigot / Paper / Purpur / Folia (1.21.11 - 26.3+)[/COLOR][/SIZE]
[HR][/HR]
[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00d2ff]1. Installation & Requirements[/COLOR][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*] Verify your server runs [B]Java 21[/B] or newer.
[*] Download and place [URL='https://github.com/retrooper/packetevents'][B]PacketEvents 2.x[/B][/URL] into your server's [FONT=Courier New]plugins/[/FONT] folder.
[*] (Optional) Install [B]LuckPerms[/B] for dynamic reactive permission tree syncing.
[*] Drop [B]PluginsHider-1.0.0.jar[/B] into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins/[/FONT] directory.
[*] Restart your server or run [FONT=Courier New]/phider reload[/FONT] after modifying configuration files.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00d2ff]2. Default Configuration Breakdown (config.yml)[/COLOR][/SIZE]
Below is the full annotated configuration file:

[CODE=yaml]
# ==============================================================================
# PluginsHider - Comprehensive Server Security & Privacy Configuration
# Author: Lino
# Compatible with Spigot, Paper, Purpur, and Folia (1.21.11 - 26.3+)
# ==============================================================================

settings:
  locale: "en"
  debug: false
  case-insensitive-commands: true

brand-spoofing:
  # Rewrites the outgoing server brand in the F3 debug screen.
  enabled: true
  server-brand: "&8[&bPlugins&3Hider&8] &7Protected"

channel-protection:
  # Prevents hacked clients from snooping registered channels via minecraft:register.
  enabled: true
  allowed-channels:
    - "minecraft:brand"
    - "bungeecord:main"
    - "velocity:main"
    - "geyserutils:main"

plugin-command-shield:
  # Intercepts direct plugin inspection commands.
  enabled: true
  blocked-commands:
    - "/plugins"
    - "/pl"
    - "/bukkit:plugins"
    - "/bukkit:pl"
    - "/version"
    - "/ver"
    - "/bukkit:version"
    - "/bukkit:ver"
    - "/about"
    - "/bukkit:about"
    - "/help"
    - "/bukkit:help"
    - "/?"
    - "/bukkit:?"
  custom-response: "&8[&bPluginsHider&8] &cCommand access denied."

rate-limiting:
  # Anti-flood rate limiter for player commands.
  enabled: true
  window-seconds: 2
  max-commands-per-window: 30
  action: KICK # KICK or BLOCK
  kick-message: "&cExcessive command activity detected. Connection terminated."

operator-security:
  # Strict operator whitelist and unauthorized de-op enforcement.
  enabled: false
  allowed-operators:
    - "Lino"
    - "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" # UUIDs are also supported
  auto-deop-unauthorized: true
  kick-unauthorized: true
  unauthorized-kick-message: "&cUnauthorized operator privilege detected."
  block-op-command-message: "&cYou are not authorized to assign operator privileges."
  sweep-interval-seconds: 5

groups:
  default:
    priority: 0
    mode: WHITELIST # WHITELIST or BLACKLIST
    blocked-message: "&cUnknown command. Type \"/help\" for help."
    commands:
      - "spawn"
      - "tpa"
      - "tpaccept"
      - "tpdeny"
      - "home"
      - "sethome"
      - "msg"
      - "r"
      - "pay"
      - "balance"
      - "bal"
      - "warp"
      - "list:utility-commands"
    tab-complete:
      - "spawn"
      - "tpa"
      - "tpaccept"
      - "tpdeny"
      - "home"
      - "sethome"
      - "msg"
      - "r"
      - "pay"
      - "balance"
      - "bal"
      - "warp"
      - "list:utility-commands"
    inherited-groups: []

  vip:
    priority: 10
    mode: WHITELIST
    blocked-message: "&cUnknown command. Type \"/help\" for help."
    commands:
      - "fly"
      - "feed"
      - "heal"
      - "workbench"
      - "craft"
    tab-complete:
      - "fly"
      - "feed"
      - "heal"
      - "workbench"
      - "craft"
    inherited-groups:
      - "default"

  admin:
    priority: 100
    mode: BLACKLIST
    blocked-message: "&cAdministrative safety lock: This command is restricted."
    commands:
      - "stop"
      - "restart"
    tab-complete: []
    inherited-groups: []
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00d2ff]3. Rule Syntax & Capabilities[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B]A. Exact & Subcommand Matching[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [FONT=Courier New]spawn[/FONT] -> Allows or blocks [FONT=Courier New]/spawn[/FONT] and any arguments passed to it.
[*] [FONT=Courier New]warp shop[/FONT] -> Matches [FONT=Courier New]/warp shop[/FONT] specifically.
[/LIST]

[B]B. Negation Rules (!)[/B]
Use exclamation marks to carve out exceptions from inherited or whitelist groups:
[CODE=yaml]
commands:
  - "warp"
  - "!warp admin_vault"
[/CODE]
In the example above, players can use [FONT=Courier New]/warp[/FONT] for any destination except [FONT=Courier New]admin_vault[/FONT]!

[B]C. Regular Expressions (regex:)[/B]
Prefix any rule with [FONT=Courier New]regex:[/FONT] for regex patterns:
[CODE=yaml]
commands:
  - "regex:^msg [a-zA-Z0-9_]+ (hello|hi)$"
[/CODE]

[B]D. Modular Command Lists (list:<filename>)[/B]
Place reusable lists in [FONT=Courier New]plugins/PluginsHider/lists/[/FONT]!
For instance, [FONT=Courier New]lists/utility-commands.yml[/FONT]:
[CODE=yaml]
utility-commands:
  - "ping"
  - "discord"
  - "vote"
[/CODE]
Then reference it in any group with [FONT=Courier New]list:utility-commands[/FONT]! Circular dependencies are automatically prevented.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00d2ff]4. Permission Nodes[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH][COLOR=#00d2ff]Permission Node[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#00d2ff]Default[/COLOR][/TH]
[TH][COLOR=#00d2ff]Functionality[/COLOR][/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.admin[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]op[/TD]
[TD]Grants full access to [FONT=Courier New]/pluginshider[/FONT] administrative tools.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.group.<name>[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Assigns the player to the specified group (e.g. [FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.group.vip[/FONT]).[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.bypass.commands[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Bypasses all command execution blocking restrictions.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.bypass.tab[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Bypasses tab completion filtering; sees all commands.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.bypass.plugins[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Allows executing [FONT=Courier New]/plugins[/FONT] to view real server plugins.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.bypass.channels[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Bypasses plugin messaging channel hiding.[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][FONT=Courier New]pluginshider.bypass.spam[/FONT][/TD]
[TD]false[/TD]
[TD]Bypasses command spam rate limiter.[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]
